    {
      "source": "Get the default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/RootBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>RootBeanDefinition</code></a> for <a href=\"../../core/KeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueTemplate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取用于 <a href=\"../../core/KeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueTemplate</code></a> 的默认 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/RootBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>RootBeanDefinition</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../../core/KeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueTemplate</code></a> bean name to potentially register a\ndefault <a href=\"../../core/KeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueTemplate</code></a> bean if no bean is registered with the\nreturned name.",
      "translation": "返回 `<a href=\"../../core/KeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueTemplate</code></a>` 的 Bean 名称，以便在尚未注册该名称对应的 Bean 时，潜在地注册一个默认的 `<a href=\"../../core/KeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueTemplate</code></a>` Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
