      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> bean name to potentially register a\ndefault mapping context bean if no bean is registered with the returned name. Defaults to\n<a href=\"#MAPPING_CONTEXT_BEAN_NAME\"><code>MAPPING_CONTEXT_BEAN_NAME</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回用于注册默认映射上下文 Bean 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> Bean 名称，如果返回的名称未注册任何 Bean，则进行注册。默认为 <a href=\"#MAPPING_CONTEXT_BEAN_NAME\"><code>MAPPING_CONTEXT_BEAN_NAME</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> bean name to potentially register a\ndefault mapping context bean if no bean is registered with the returned name.",
      "translation": "返回 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>` 的 Bean 名称，如果该名称下未注册任何 Bean，则可能注册一个默认的 MappingContext Bean。",
      "count": 1
    },
